# Privacy Policy — "Qanawi Tower" App

**Effective date:** October 14, 2026

The "Qanawi Tower" app (`com.qanawi.tower`) is an internal app for managing the accounts of the Qanawi Tower owners' association. Building management uses it to record each unit's fees and issue payment receipts. Each resident uses it to follow their own unit's account and receipts. The app is intended only for the tower's residents and management.

## 1. Data we collect

**Data you provide when you register**
- Full name
- Email address
- Mobile number
- The unit you select
- Password: handled entirely by Firebase Authentication. We cannot see it.

**Data entered by building management**
- Unit details: code, floor, wing, owner/resident name, and occupancy status.
- Monthly fees and other charges, such as elevator and camera contributions or a balance carried over from previous years.
- Payments and receipts: amount, date, payment method, months covered, and notes.

**Technical data**
- **Push notification token (FCM token):** an identifier the notification system creates for your device. We use it only to send you this app's notifications.
- **App version number:** read on your device to check whether an update is required. It is not sent or stored.

**What we do not collect**
The app does not collect your location and does not access your camera, photos, or contacts. It contains no ads and no analytics or tracking tools.

## 2. How we use data
- To create your account, confirm that you are a resident, and link you to your unit.
- To show your unit's account: paid and overdue months, and your receipts.
- To send notifications about your account (such as a received payment or account activation) and general announcements from management.
- To let management track collections and unit accounts.

We do not sell your data or use it for marketing or advertising.

## 3. Who can see your data
- **You:** only your own unit's data and receipts. You cannot see any other unit.
- **Building management:** all units and registered residents, for administration and collection.
- **Service providers:**
  - **Google Firebase** (Authentication, Cloud Firestore, Cloud Messaging), for storage, sign-in, and notifications. See [Google's Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy).
  - **The app's notification relay server:** receives only the notification text and your device's notification token, to pass the notification to Firebase Cloud Messaging.

We may disclose data if a competent legal authority lawfully requires it.

## 4. Security
- All traffic between the app and the servers is encrypted (HTTPS/TLS).
- Database security rules prevent a resident from reading another unit's data or changing any account or receipt. Only management can make changes.
- Receipts are never deleted. A cancelled receipt is kept and marked "void" so the records stay accurate.

## 5. Retention
- We keep your account data for as long as your account is active.
- Unit, payment, and receipt records are part of the association's financial records. They are kept after a resident account is deleted, because they belong to the unit and not to the personal account.

## 6. Your rights and account deletion
At any time, you can ask us to:
- give you a copy of your personal data;
- correct your data, such as your name, mobile number, or unit;
- delete your account.

To make a request, email building management at the address below from the email registered on your account. When we delete an account, we delete your personal data: name, email, mobile number, notification token, and sign-in account. We do this within 30 days at most.

## 7. Children
The app is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.

## 8. Changes to this policy
We may update this policy. We publish the updated version on this page with a new effective date, and we notify you in the app if a change is significant.

